From 2be2697d0e50d0a57e8c15e5318930c57e904273 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:51:29 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: each cup has its own trophy design

Nine distinct 16 x 16 placeholder sprites in cup order: 309 cup, 310 pennant,
311 shield, 312 star on a plinth, 313 sword in a stone, 315 laurel wreath,
316 crown, 317 gem on a plinth, 318 mask (bronze, silver, gold, blue by tier).
Rows 315 to 318 of sprites.tsv and layout.tsv; art from
scripts/gen-trophy-sprites.py. Both placement tables use them.

Sprite memory with all nine trophies, the champion and the scout standing:
350 of 512 blocks used, 162 free (68 more than with no trophies); message
windows stay clean. The sprite data grew past the start of the last ROM
region, so main.ld moves it up 0x1000 (ROM_END_tbs 0x08806000).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
