 games/tbs/src/graphics/sprite/layout.tsv  |  4 +++
 games/tbs/src/graphics/sprite/sprites.tsv |  8 +++---
 games/tbs/src/scene/battle_arena.c        | 32 +++++++++++------------
 4 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

